1
00:01:36,009 --> 00:01:39,830
[Abyss]

2
00:01:49,759 --> 00:01:50,500
Go on.

3
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:51,920
Keep playing.

4
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:05,480
[Episode 11]

5
00:03:06,340 --> 00:03:07,180
Pardon?

6
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:10,530
24/7 surveillance on Sun Qiang?

7
00:03:11,020 --> 00:03:11,950
For what reason?

8
00:03:13,780 --> 00:03:15,530
Firstly, he has no valid alibi

9
00:03:15,530 --> 00:03:17,900
for the time of the crime.

10
00:03:17,910 --> 00:03:19,930
Secondly, his shoe size and pattern

11
00:03:19,950 --> 00:03:21,980
highly match the half footprint

12
00:03:22,010 --> 00:03:23,210
we found at the scene.

13
00:03:23,210 --> 00:03:25,130
Thirdly, he has recently gotten

14
00:03:25,150 --> 00:03:27,470
unexplained injuries
consistent with a fight.

15
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:29,970
He knows me, Han Pinmu,
and Zhang Chengguo,

16
00:03:29,970 --> 00:03:31,970
so he has sources to get our information.

17
00:03:31,970 --> 00:03:34,220
Fourthly, the funding source
for his internet cafe is

18
00:03:34,220 --> 00:03:35,020
also highly suspicious.

19
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:36,579
Pointless.
Everything you said is pointless.

20
00:03:36,579 --> 00:03:37,579
Motive.

21
00:03:37,740 --> 00:03:39,250
I need a motive.

22
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:41,500
Why would he steal Zhang Chengguo's phone?

23
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:43,030
Why would he frame Zhang Chengguo?

24
00:03:43,030 --> 00:03:44,800
Why would he pin it on Han Pinmu?

25
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,270
Why would he target you first

26
00:03:46,270 --> 00:03:47,840
yet end up killing your master?

27
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,360
Isn't this contradictory?

28
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,710
Is he deranged?

29
00:03:53,370 --> 00:03:54,120
We haven't

30
00:03:54,150 --> 00:03:55,740
fully figured out the motive yet.

31
00:03:55,740 --> 00:03:57,310
But we strongly suspect

32
00:03:57,310 --> 00:03:59,900
that Sun Qiang might be a hired killer.

33
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,870
Guangwen, he's a security guard!

34
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:03,860
Not a professional killer!

35
00:04:03,860 --> 00:04:05,270
Besides, the victim was

36
00:04:05,290 --> 00:04:08,060
a veteran cop he didn't even know.

37
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:09,460
How would he dare to do it?

38
00:04:11,340 --> 00:04:13,580
This may be a bold suspicion,

39
00:04:13,580 --> 00:04:14,780
but it's based on facts.

40
00:04:14,780 --> 00:04:17,010
Sun Qiang has been acting weirdly lately.

41
00:04:17,010 --> 00:04:18,540
His financial activity has been abnormal.

42
00:04:18,540 --> 00:04:20,040
He's even been unusually alert

43
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:22,390
to the police investigation.

44
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,240
Only by keeping a close eye on him

45
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,770
can we figure it out.

46
00:04:26,420 --> 00:04:27,220
Li Cheng,

47
00:04:27,690 --> 00:04:29,180
your Master was murdered,

48
00:04:29,250 --> 00:04:30,870
so you're eager to catch the killer.

49
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:32,500
I completely understand that.

50
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:33,830
And I fully support you.

51
00:04:33,870 --> 00:04:35,200
But what's the reality?

52
00:04:35,300 --> 00:04:36,360
The reality is that

53
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,990
Xu Ling and Wang Tao are working

54
00:04:39,010 --> 00:04:40,770
on that national theft ring case.

55
00:04:40,770 --> 00:04:42,220
They've barely slept in 2 days.

56
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:43,690
And Yang Feng and Hu Sen

57
00:04:43,690 --> 00:04:44,630
are preparing

58
00:04:44,650 --> 00:04:47,510
materials for the provincial
annual special-governance inspection.

59
00:04:47,510 --> 00:04:48,310
As you can see,

60
00:04:48,330 --> 00:04:49,270
we only have this many people.

61
00:04:49,270 --> 00:04:50,659
You can go out and take a look now.

62
00:04:50,659 --> 00:04:51,630
At this critical moment,

63
00:04:51,630 --> 00:04:53,220
5 departments are working together.

64
00:04:53,220 --> 00:04:55,440
Chief Tu and I have almost been
living in the station.

65
00:04:55,440 --> 00:04:56,710
How do you expect me

66
00:04:56,710 --> 00:04:59,110
to arrange some 24/7 surveillance for you?

67
00:04:59,170 --> 00:05:00,150
Fan Jie!

68
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,880
Zhao was just laid to rest not long ago!

69
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:04,830
We've finally got a clue,

70
00:05:04,830 --> 00:05:06,650
and you're denying everything.

71
00:05:06,730 --> 00:05:07,680
Is this how you treat Zhao?

72
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,340
Is this how you act as a friend?

73
00:05:09,410 --> 00:05:10,410
Guangwen,

74
00:05:10,770 --> 00:05:11,440
you're not

75
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:13,410
the only one hurting over Zhao's death!

76
00:05:13,410 --> 00:05:14,620
I must answer to the bureau

77
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:16,160
as the captain
of the Criminal Investigation Brigade!

78
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,800
Yes, every suspicion you raised

79
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,230
might be right.

80
00:05:19,350 --> 00:05:20,230
But tell me

81
00:05:20,420 --> 00:05:22,350
which one actually points

82
00:05:22,410 --> 00:05:24,410
to Sun Qiang as the suspect
who killed Zhao!

83
00:05:24,410 --> 00:05:25,120
Which one?

84
00:05:26,230 --> 00:05:27,530
Every police deployment

85
00:05:27,530 --> 00:05:29,110
needs to be reasonable!

86
00:05:29,670 --> 00:05:31,790
The whole bureau is overloaded right now.

87
00:05:31,790 --> 00:05:32,850
So what should I do?

88
00:05:33,150 --> 00:05:34,120
Help you monitor him?

89
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:36,409
Put all our energy
on a little security guard?

90
00:05:36,409 --> 00:05:37,770
Fine, for how long?

91
00:05:38,060 --> 00:05:39,090
What if we come up empty?

92
00:05:39,090 --> 00:05:42,150
Shall we just drop all the other cases
we're working on?

93
00:05:51,310 --> 00:05:56,590
[Here lies my beloved father, Zhao Ganzhe]

94
00:06:13,650 --> 00:06:15,530
Dead people can't drink.

95
00:06:16,110 --> 00:06:19,240
Pouring it on the ground
only pollutes the environment.

96
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,790
Han Pinmu?

97
00:06:24,790 --> 00:06:25,800
Officer Xin,

98
00:06:26,530 --> 00:06:28,790
if we're only counting proper meetings,

99
00:06:29,330 --> 00:06:31,670
it's been years
since we last met each other.

100
00:06:31,670 --> 00:06:33,000
What are you doing here?

101
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,530
This is a public cemetery.

102
00:06:35,730 --> 00:06:38,770
Birth, aging, sickness, and death
are just part of life.

103
00:06:38,770 --> 00:06:41,170
You're not the only one
who's lost someone.

104
00:06:41,590 --> 00:06:42,590
Not many people

105
00:06:43,420 --> 00:06:45,950
get their own family members killed,
though.

106
00:06:57,900 --> 00:06:59,560
You're trying to irritate me?

107
00:07:04,370 --> 00:07:05,240
Kid,

108
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:09,700
I didn't spend 6 years
in prison for nothing.

109
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,420
I won't get worked up that easily.

110
00:07:12,530 --> 00:07:14,560
Whatever tricks you have,

111
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,960
bring them on.

112
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,580
If my life is what you want,

113
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,440
then just take it.

114
00:07:21,470 --> 00:07:22,910
I came to see my mom

115
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,030
and happened to run into you.

116
00:07:25,390 --> 00:07:27,090
I just came to say hi,

117
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:30,290
but I guess I'm just being annoying.

118
00:07:36,790 --> 00:07:38,170
[Here lies my beloved father, Zhao Ganzhe]

119
00:07:39,150 --> 00:07:40,530
It's been 8 years.

120
00:07:40,740 --> 00:07:42,740
Why did you only kill Song Laifu now?

121
00:07:42,850 --> 00:07:45,050
I don't know what you're talking about.

122
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,920
Some things, once they happen,

123
00:07:50,540 --> 00:07:52,909
never change with the passage of time.

124
00:08:01,300 --> 00:08:03,830
I never expected you
to tell the truth anyway.

125
00:08:04,620 --> 00:08:05,860
Hope I can get you

126
00:08:07,230 --> 00:08:09,560
into a different outfit next time we meet.

127
00:08:17,710 --> 00:08:20,050
I think Officer Zhao
was very different from you.

128
00:08:20,050 --> 00:08:21,830
At least he was a good father.

129
00:08:21,580 --> 00:08:23,250
[Erected by his daughter, Zhao Ying]

130
00:08:25,210 --> 00:08:26,830
What's his daughter's name again?

131
00:08:26,830 --> 00:08:28,180
Zhao Ying, right?

132
00:08:28,180 --> 00:08:29,240
I will kill you if you dare

133
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,700
lay a finger on his family!

134
00:08:36,470 --> 00:08:37,000
Didn't you say

135
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:39,200
you wouldn't get worked up that easily?

136
00:08:41,620 --> 00:08:43,780
You couldn't catch the bad guys
when you were a cop

137
00:08:43,780 --> 00:08:46,000
and got caught by the cops
when you were a bad guy.

138
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,070
The law can only punish

139
00:08:47,070 --> 00:08:48,620
some idiots like you.

140
00:08:48,830 --> 00:08:50,230
Don't you want to kill me?

141
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,090
Come on, do it!

142
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,020
I'll be watching you closely.

143
00:08:59,250 --> 00:09:00,120
If you cops had

144
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:02,730
gotten to the bottom
of how my mom died back then,

145
00:09:02,730 --> 00:09:05,060
none of these messes would have happened.

146
00:09:05,090 --> 00:09:06,280
You guys deserve it.

147
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,580
You deserve it!

148
00:09:23,690 --> 00:09:24,360
Hello?

149
00:09:25,970 --> 00:09:27,100
What surveillance?

150
00:09:29,810 --> 00:09:31,270
Why don't you go yourself?

151
00:09:32,690 --> 00:09:34,330
We got a last-minute meeting notice.

152
00:09:34,330 --> 00:09:35,760
Chief Tu is hosting it in person.

153
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,140
All the city leaders are here.

154
00:09:37,140 --> 00:09:38,330
I really can't go.

155
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:39,920
Are you sure this will work?

156
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:40,830
I'm not so sure.

157
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:41,940
Let's try it first.

158
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:43,880
This guy's behavior in front of Mr. Li

159
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:45,540
and me was really impressive.

160
00:09:46,430 --> 00:09:47,680
You're the only one who can help me.

161
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:48,810
I'm counting on you.

162
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:36,540
Where is the plant in that pot?

163
00:10:41,380 --> 00:10:42,640
It died.

164
00:10:43,090 --> 00:10:44,570
I saw its leaves withered,

165
00:10:45,260 --> 00:10:46,610
so I disposed of it.

166
00:10:49,100 --> 00:10:50,950
Where did you throw it?

167
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:04,210
If Mr. Li asks about it,

168
00:11:04,830 --> 00:11:06,490
how should I explain it to him?

169
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:10,230
Like, it was unlucky

170
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:13,490
and couldn't live to see him again?

171
00:11:15,740 --> 00:11:16,890
No,

172
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,810
Mr. Li has long forgotten it.

173
00:11:22,350 --> 00:11:23,970
He wouldn't know anything.

174
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:27,130
He forgot,

175
00:11:27,550 --> 00:11:29,380
but you'll remind him.

176
00:11:30,550 --> 00:11:31,850
I won't.

177
00:11:31,890 --> 00:11:32,900
I haven't told him

178
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:34,930
a word about our relationship.

179
00:11:35,020 --> 00:11:36,070
Don't worry.

180
00:11:37,610 --> 00:11:39,260
I treated it so well,

181
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:43,190
watering and fertilizing it.

182
00:11:46,310 --> 00:11:48,550
How would it dare to die before you?

183
00:12:02,790 --> 00:12:03,810
Listen,

184
00:12:04,210 --> 00:12:06,540
I hold sway over everything in this house,

185
00:12:07,140 --> 00:12:09,970
be it dead

186
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:12,000
or alive.

187
00:12:15,090 --> 00:12:15,950
Got it?

188
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,260
Yes.

189
00:12:33,110 --> 00:12:34,670
Is dinner still not ready?

190
00:12:34,780 --> 00:12:35,660
I'm hungry.

191
00:12:36,770 --> 00:12:37,680
Almost ready.

192
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:43,600
Keep playing it.

193
00:13:22,590 --> 00:13:23,710
Woof, woof.

194
00:14:20,430 --> 00:14:24,030
[Sun Qiang is calling]

195
00:14:24,060 --> 00:14:25,390
[14 Missed Calls]

196
00:14:44,450 --> 00:14:45,470
Mom.

197
00:14:48,940 --> 00:14:51,300
Dad, what's wrong with Mom?

198
00:15:17,860 --> 00:15:18,710
Son,

199
00:15:20,300 --> 00:15:21,830
I'm not your dad.

200
00:15:25,420 --> 00:15:27,240
Your surname should be Li.

201
00:15:28,050 --> 00:15:32,760
[Sun Qiang is calling]

202
00:15:42,750 --> 00:15:43,950
Our county newly installed

203
00:15:43,950 --> 00:15:45,670
56 more surveillance cameras last month,

204
00:15:45,670 --> 00:15:46,710
including some

205
00:15:46,740 --> 00:15:47,760
at Riverside Square,

206
00:15:47,760 --> 00:15:48,570
Shatou Park,

207
00:15:48,570 --> 00:15:49,510
and Happiness Park.

208
00:15:49,510 --> 00:15:51,040
So whether you're playing truth

209
00:15:51,040 --> 00:15:52,090
or dare,

210
00:15:52,090 --> 00:15:53,420
it makes no difference.

211
00:16:59,260 --> 00:17:05,099
[Police]

212
00:17:57,900 --> 00:17:58,600
Hello?

213
00:17:59,060 --> 00:18:00,000
Where are you?

214
00:18:01,010 --> 00:18:02,120
At your door.

215
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:02,990
Open up.

216
00:18:07,790 --> 00:18:09,090
What happened?

217
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:17,160
He was obviously playing a trick on you.

218
00:18:18,140 --> 00:18:20,990
Whether there are cameras or not,
you can't go anyway.

219
00:18:20,990 --> 00:18:22,160
I'm not that stupid.

220
00:18:22,350 --> 00:18:23,880
I'll ask you one more time.

221
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:25,220
Did you go there or not?

222
00:18:25,220 --> 00:18:26,130
Nope!

223
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,250
Mr. Xin,

224
00:18:42,270 --> 00:18:43,450
so you're here.

225
00:18:44,120 --> 00:18:45,590
I've been looking for you for ages.

226
00:18:45,590 --> 00:18:46,790
What brings you here?

227
00:18:47,660 --> 00:18:48,680
It's so cold.

228
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:49,940
I brought you a jacket.

229
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:51,450
Here you are.

230
00:18:58,250 --> 00:18:59,200
Before coming here,

231
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:00,990
I took a long detour outside.

232
00:19:01,140 --> 00:19:02,560
I was being careful enough.

233
00:19:02,560 --> 00:19:03,850
You thought about it.

234
00:19:04,190 --> 00:19:05,450
You almost went there.

235
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:08,590
What's the point of saying this?

236
00:19:08,590 --> 00:19:10,030
Why are you changing the subject?

237
00:19:10,030 --> 00:19:11,360
If you want to back out of paying,
just say it.

238
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:12,420
I did the job

239
00:19:12,510 --> 00:19:13,510
and took the fall.

240
00:19:13,810 --> 00:19:15,270
You can't short me a penny.

241
00:19:17,610 --> 00:19:19,070
Who did I tell you to kill?

242
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:22,180
How could you mistake a 100-kg fat guy

243
00:19:22,180 --> 00:19:23,290
for Li Cheng?

244
00:19:24,110 --> 00:19:26,510
You even killed the deputy police captain!

245
00:19:26,700 --> 00:19:28,510
Do you know how big of a mess this is?

246
00:19:28,510 --> 00:19:30,460
Hey, who would want that?

247
00:19:31,790 --> 00:19:32,860
It was so dark!

248
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,490
It was pitch black.

249
00:19:35,850 --> 00:19:37,420
I gritted my teeth and rushed in too fast.

250
00:19:37,420 --> 00:19:38,530
By the time I saw it wasn't Li Cheng,

251
00:19:38,530 --> 00:19:40,110
I had already stabbed him.

252
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:55,340
[Pomelo Sparkling Water]

253
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:57,010
We can

254
00:19:58,270 --> 00:19:59,490
negotiate the price.

255
00:20:00,050 --> 00:20:01,780
Forget about the 100,000 yuan.

256
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:04,140
How about 80,000?

257
00:20:04,950 --> 00:20:05,620
Deal?

258
00:20:06,640 --> 00:20:07,370
80,000 yuan.

259
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:11,690
Well...

260
00:20:19,510 --> 00:20:21,970
How much did Han Pinmu pay you

261
00:20:23,140 --> 00:20:25,270
to screw me over like this?

262
00:20:25,350 --> 00:20:26,330
Zhang Chengguo,

263
00:20:26,350 --> 00:20:27,720
do not slander me!

264
00:20:27,750 --> 00:20:29,250
Then tell me,

265
00:20:30,300 --> 00:20:32,020
why is Han Pinmu fine?

266
00:20:32,040 --> 00:20:33,590
Why is Li Cheng fine?

267
00:20:33,620 --> 00:20:34,550
Only the two of us

268
00:20:34,570 --> 00:20:36,330
are being chased by the cops like rats!

269
00:20:36,330 --> 00:20:37,770
You should ask yourself.

270
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:38,720
I...

271
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:41,390
did as you said.

272
00:20:59,070 --> 00:21:01,000
Thanks for your hard work, Mr. Xin.

273
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:07,090
My longest stakeout record is

274
00:21:08,360 --> 00:21:09,610
48 hours,

275
00:21:10,990 --> 00:21:12,900
with no food, no water,

276
00:21:13,830 --> 00:21:14,830
and no moving.

277
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:17,440
I peed my pants

278
00:21:18,590 --> 00:21:20,010
until I had nothing left.

279
00:21:21,460 --> 00:21:23,420
Was there no one to take over?

280
00:21:23,830 --> 00:21:25,230
What about your partner?

281
00:21:28,960 --> 00:21:29,660
I had one.

282
00:21:44,620 --> 00:21:47,720
That was an emergency.

283
00:21:48,330 --> 00:21:50,990
He hiked for dozens of kilometers alone

284
00:21:53,470 --> 00:21:54,710
to get backup

285
00:21:55,810 --> 00:21:58,900
and almost died halfway.

286
00:22:00,030 --> 00:22:01,400
I didn't expect him

287
00:22:01,620 --> 00:22:03,620
to survive all that,

288
00:22:04,120 --> 00:22:05,250
yet end up...

289
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:09,940
End up falling here.

290
00:22:20,550 --> 00:22:24,160
Is it possible
that Sun Qiang just won't come?

291
00:22:24,380 --> 00:22:26,640
I spent years in criminal investigation

292
00:22:27,090 --> 00:22:27,750
and learned

293
00:22:27,750 --> 00:22:30,550
never to neglect
even the slightest possibility.

294
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:33,090
Sometimes,
what seems like a pointless wait

295
00:22:33,090 --> 00:22:35,150
is actually the fastest way forward.

296
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:42,530
Just go do what you need to do.

297
00:22:42,940 --> 00:22:44,070
I'm watching here.

298
00:22:44,940 --> 00:22:46,640
Let me, an old useless guy,

299
00:22:47,380 --> 00:22:48,580
scout the way for you.

300
00:22:53,830 --> 00:22:56,030
Then I'll stay with you a little longer.

301
00:22:59,270 --> 00:23:00,070
Bro,

302
00:23:00,330 --> 00:23:02,550
don't... Don't worry.

303
00:23:03,050 --> 00:23:04,290
How could I possibly harm you?

304
00:23:04,290 --> 00:23:05,460
We're in the same boat.

305
00:23:05,460 --> 00:23:07,190
Harming you is harming myself.

306
00:23:07,590 --> 00:23:08,310
Besides,

307
00:23:08,880 --> 00:23:10,350
the police have no evidence.

308
00:23:10,350 --> 00:23:12,180
They're already onto us.

309
00:23:13,710 --> 00:23:16,510
Can you guarantee
you've covered all your tracks?

310
00:23:17,590 --> 00:23:19,590
Then I'll go out and hide for a while.

311
00:23:23,890 --> 00:23:25,150
You want to run?

312
00:23:25,720 --> 00:23:26,640
I...

313
00:23:52,640 --> 00:23:53,840
Take this 20,000 yuan

314
00:23:54,490 --> 00:23:55,940
to get by for now.

315
00:23:56,380 --> 00:23:58,090
I'll pay you the rest later.

316
00:23:59,590 --> 00:24:01,940
You can't run!

317
00:24:02,880 --> 00:24:04,770
If you run, it'll be all over!

318
00:24:06,950 --> 00:24:09,330
Don't you want the internet cafe
you've been craving?

319
00:24:09,330 --> 00:24:11,930
You're finally going to open it
and be the boss.

320
00:24:12,700 --> 00:24:14,270
It'll all be over.

321
00:24:17,290 --> 00:24:18,120
Here.

322
00:24:19,220 --> 00:24:20,090
Take it!

323
00:24:29,640 --> 00:24:30,250
[Chapter 8]

324
00:24:30,270 --> 00:24:31,150
[That seemingly insignificant negligence]

325
00:24:31,170 --> 00:24:32,010
[was like a push to the first Dominino.]

326
00:24:32,040 --> 00:24:33,160
[Starting from that moment,
all tracks went off course,]

327
00:24:33,190 --> 00:24:34,290
[sending everything
to the abyss out of control.]

328
00:24:41,200 --> 00:24:41,460
[Delete]

329
00:24:41,570 --> 00:24:42,810
[Delete] [Yes]

330
00:24:42,840 --> 00:24:42,940
[New Folder] [The Chapters of "Abyss"]

331
00:24:44,180 --> 00:24:44,800
[Recycling Bin]

332
00:24:44,800 --> 00:24:45,640
[Chapter 8 of "Abyss"]

333
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:46,860
[Delete]

334
00:24:46,860 --> 00:24:47,330
[Delete]

335
00:24:47,360 --> 00:24:48,020
[Are you going to delete it forever?]
[Yes]

336
00:25:20,860 --> 00:25:22,380
Mr. Han,

337
00:25:22,990 --> 00:25:23,900
your equipment here

338
00:25:23,900 --> 00:25:25,680
can't even compare
to what I've got in my new shop.

339
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:27,830
We're on completely different levels.

340
00:25:27,830 --> 00:25:30,760
Do you seriously
want to compete with me in business?

341
00:25:42,440 --> 00:25:43,680
What's wrong?

342
00:25:44,180 --> 00:25:45,110
Are you sick?

343
00:25:45,440 --> 00:25:47,700
You were the one who set that fire, right?

344
00:25:55,460 --> 00:25:56,790
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

345
00:25:57,970 --> 00:25:59,640
I had to.

346
00:26:00,310 --> 00:26:02,960
Zhang Chengguo suspected me
of taking money from both sides.

347
00:26:02,960 --> 00:26:04,620
I'm not innocent, though.

348
00:26:05,350 --> 00:26:07,870
But I had to make the act look real.

349
00:26:07,890 --> 00:26:09,060
Besides,

350
00:26:09,090 --> 00:26:11,010
setting a fire was no big deal.

351
00:26:11,040 --> 00:26:13,080
I saved your life the other day, remember?

352
00:26:13,080 --> 00:26:15,010
If I hadn't called you,

353
00:26:15,040 --> 00:26:16,840
would you still be sitting here?

354
00:26:20,750 --> 00:26:23,680
That information is worth
at least 80,000 yuan, huh?

355
00:26:27,700 --> 00:26:29,900
If I had actually gone there that night,

356
00:26:30,250 --> 00:26:32,310
how were you planning to deal with me?

357
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:33,850
What do you mean?

358
00:26:37,300 --> 00:26:38,210
Sun Qiang,

359
00:26:38,610 --> 00:26:39,570
seriously,

360
00:26:40,200 --> 00:26:42,400
you remind me a lot of some people I know.

361
00:26:42,660 --> 00:26:44,310
You'll do anything

362
00:26:44,330 --> 00:26:45,590
to achieve your goals.

363
00:26:46,940 --> 00:26:48,010
I kind of respect that.

364
00:26:48,010 --> 00:26:49,100
Come on.

365
00:26:50,030 --> 00:26:51,560
We know each other too well.

366
00:26:52,310 --> 00:26:53,920
I'm the one you look down on the most.

367
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:56,220
That's why I have to get
this internet cafe running

368
00:26:56,220 --> 00:26:58,180
prosperously and successfully.

369
00:26:58,200 --> 00:27:01,200
Otherwise, I'd never be able
to respect myself for the rest of my life,

370
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:02,790
and it would be a waste

371
00:27:03,330 --> 00:27:05,420
of your contempt for me back then.

372
00:27:06,490 --> 00:27:07,360
So?

373
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:09,810
To make others respect you,

374
00:27:09,810 --> 00:27:11,410
you'd even dare to kill a cop?

375
00:27:12,120 --> 00:27:13,310
Who killed a cop?

376
00:27:13,550 --> 00:27:14,480
You didn't do it?

377
00:27:15,080 --> 00:27:17,330
Then it was Zhang Chengguo, right?

378
00:27:25,940 --> 00:27:27,920
You don't need
to fish for information from me.

379
00:27:27,920 --> 00:27:29,960
I'm just a nobody

380
00:27:30,030 --> 00:27:31,360
delivering messages

381
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:33,470
and running errands.

382
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,770
Here is 50,000 yuan.

383
00:27:52,810 --> 00:27:54,850
Let me know the next time

384
00:27:54,850 --> 00:27:55,850
you two make a deal,

385
00:27:55,850 --> 00:27:57,910
and I'll pay you another 50,000 yuan.

386
00:28:06,120 --> 00:28:08,030
Don't look at me like that.

387
00:28:08,350 --> 00:28:09,420
I deserve this.

388
00:28:12,700 --> 00:28:14,500
How are things going on your end?

389
00:28:14,900 --> 00:28:15,900
Mr. Li and I

390
00:28:16,110 --> 00:28:18,040
plan to meet Zhang Chengguo again.

391
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:20,110
Although Zhang Chengguo has an alibi,

392
00:28:20,110 --> 00:28:22,610
that doesn't mean
he has nothing to do with this case.

393
00:28:22,610 --> 00:28:23,610
What do you think?

394
00:28:24,090 --> 00:28:25,880
You've got nothing in your hands now.

395
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:27,480
How are you going to beat him?

396
00:28:27,510 --> 00:28:29,240
They're almost at their limit.

397
00:28:29,420 --> 00:28:30,900
If we put a little more pressure,

398
00:28:30,900 --> 00:28:32,630
someone might just break down.

399
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:33,700
I think...

400
00:28:34,530 --> 00:28:36,490
I think we're rushing it.
Don't you think so?

401
00:28:36,490 --> 00:28:37,940
They have no way out now.

402
00:28:38,110 --> 00:28:39,770
If we keep doing nothing,

403
00:28:39,790 --> 00:28:40,720
we're very likely

404
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:42,460
to see another victim.

405
00:28:42,460 --> 00:28:44,550
Instead of waiting for the worst outcome,

406
00:28:44,550 --> 00:28:46,880
we might as well take back the initiative.

407
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:55,970
[Happiness Park]

408
00:28:57,750 --> 00:29:00,550
There's a surveillance camera
installed in here?

409
00:29:01,710 --> 00:29:02,810
He must be lying.

410
00:29:06,790 --> 00:29:10,560
[Happiness Park]

411
00:29:41,590 --> 00:29:42,550
Hello, Ms. Wu.

412
00:29:42,550 --> 00:29:43,010
Hello.

413
00:29:43,010 --> 00:29:44,830
These two are police officers.

414
00:29:46,830 --> 00:29:47,920
Did something happen?

415
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:50,030
There are some things
they need to ask you about,

416
00:29:50,030 --> 00:29:51,710
and they need you to fill out this form.

417
00:29:51,710 --> 00:29:53,710
We'd appreciate your cooperation.

418
00:29:55,830 --> 00:29:56,790
Come in, please.

419
00:30:14,050 --> 00:30:14,750
Hello?

420
00:30:15,610 --> 00:30:16,390
What?

421
00:30:19,430 --> 00:30:21,430
Why did the police come to our place?

422
00:30:22,440 --> 00:30:23,440
What did they ask?

423
00:30:25,090 --> 00:30:27,290
When did they come? When did they leave?

424
00:30:34,700 --> 00:30:35,530
Okay.

425
00:30:36,310 --> 00:30:37,180
I got it.

426
00:30:39,360 --> 00:30:40,670
Keep your mouth shut.

427
00:30:52,530 --> 00:30:54,440
Did you go to Happiness Park?

428
00:30:54,460 --> 00:30:56,070
And someone spotted you, right?

429
00:30:56,070 --> 00:30:57,620
Let's meet tonight,

430
00:30:57,760 --> 00:31:00,130
talk things over, and figure out a plan.

431
00:31:02,940 --> 00:31:04,990
You came fishing empty-handed?

432
00:31:05,020 --> 00:31:06,350
That's not the right attitude.
